  "details": "It might be helpful to inform world creators about long loading times, and how they can avoid them. \n# Why?\nCreators might not be aware of their world taking unusually long to load. Encouraging optimization would improve the experience of players.\n# Proposed implementation\nLog the time it took for a world to load. If loading took longer than X seconds, show a warning instead. Add documentation on how to improve a world's loading time.",
